{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_27","type":"agent_message","text":"The Hub checks passed for two players, four players with simulated latency and packet loss, and a departing host. Headless WebGPU readback failed in this environment, so I’m using state checks for gameplay and the engine’s WebGL backend for visual inspection. The title scene and flight HUD look sound; I also fixed mouse steering carrying over from menu clicks.\n"}}
